data: {"event":"message","conversation_id":"8166d031-ea9b-4218-a597-fc93ffc93155","message_id":"db7d6cb2-c21b-46dd-85b5-99499214ff22","created_at":1793605891,"task_id":"3167d9e4-f7f5-43e9-ab84-e2b4a1fa1e04","id":"db7d6cb2-c21b-46dd-85b5-99499214ff22","answer":"· 玩家【通缉演示三】对老周做了：把一只假蟑螂塞进老周的杯垫底下。老周的反应：老周怒瞪你一眼，把假蟑螂踢到你脚边，嘴里骂道：。怒气+3。\n· 玩家把招牌菜喂给黄狗，老周怒气冲冲，怒气 +4\n· 玩家偷偷把老周的招牌酒换成兑水的假酒，老周怒气冲天，要求玩家重新酿制（怒气 +5）\n· 老周被辣得直咳嗽，记下了这次恶作剧（怒气 +3）","from_variable_selector":["parse_recall","ledger"]}

data: {"event":"node_finished","conversation_id":"8166d031-ea9b-4218-a597-fc93ffc93155","message_id":"db7d6cb2-c21b-46dd-85b5-99499214ff22","created_at":1793605891,"task_id":"3167d9e4-f7f5-43e9-ab84-e2b4a1fa1e04","workflow_run_id":"127c796d-c5ba-4092-a164-2bae98083dff","data":{"id":"05a1222e-8039-4ece-8ce4-a4f2fa4021d5","node_id":"parse_llm","node_type":"code","title":"解析老周的反应","index":9,"predecessor_node_id":null,"inputs":{"raw":"老周怒骂一声，一把掀翻旁边的小桌，桌上的酒瓶摔得四分五裂，他瞪着你，怒气值直接爆表，怒气+5。\n\n{\"reply\":\"老周怒骂一声，一把掀翻旁边的小桌，桌上的酒瓶摔得四分五裂，他瞪着你，怒气值直接爆表，怒气+5。\",\"verdict\":\"暴怒\",\"grudge_delta\":5,\"memory\":\"玩家锯短了老周常坐的藤椅一条腿，老周把小桌掀翻，怒气+5。\"}","player":"通缉演示三","action":"趁打烊前把老周常坐的藤椅锯短两厘米","grudge_total":15,"knowledge":[{"metadata":{"_source":"knowledge","dataset_id":"08e2abca-e168-42ee-9cf1-85036e3066e9","dataset_name":"记仇酒馆·恶作剧图鉴","document_id":"da8a49c0-7b4a-4bf3-9786-1f21cee9e875","document_name":"prank_compendium.md","data_source_type":"upload_file","segment_id":"3e364e18-df31-4f7f-8176-e3e14deaac73","retriever_from":"workflow","score":0.5874355975598968,"child_chunks":[],"segment_hit_count":5,"segment_word_count":176,"segment_position":5,"segment_index_node_hash":"51aa7b1de7dd3739425738ffbe17279c61c0bd8e865b5d5025341b5feeb7d194","doc_metadata":null,"position":1},"title":"prank_compendium.md","files":null,"content":"锯短椅腿\n- 招式名：锯短一条椅腿\n- 操作方式：趁打烊前把老周常坐的藤椅一条腿锯短两厘米。\n- 预期效果：老周一屁股坐下去重心不稳，连人带椅翻倒。\n- 老周的反应：躺在地上先笑，笑完爬起来把椅子腿钉回去，还在椅背上刻了你的名字。\n- 反制手段：那把椅子成了“仇人专座”，坐上去会晃，酒也给你倒得特别满。\n- 危险度：★★★（容易摔伤，老周会真的生气）","summary":null},{"metadata":{"_source":"knowledge","dataset_id":"08e2abca-e168-42ee-9cf1-85036e3066e9","dataset_name":"记仇酒馆·恶作剧图鉴","document_id":"da8a49c0-7b4a-4bf3-9786-1f21cee9e875","document_name":"prank_compendium.md","data_source_type":"upload_file","segment_id":"7b31dfb4-6c7f-44f1-a441-0801cd964b8f","retriever_from":"workflow","score":0.5090560643360866,"child_chunks":[],"segment_hit_count":34,"segment_word_count":166,"segment_position":6,"segment_index_node_hash":"7976c0c6f6f32b9cf80253849a061ae544741c521dc7776b66c217c1c442c6f3","doc_metadata":null,"position":2},"title":"prank_compendium.md","files":null,"content":"胶水杯底\n- 招式名：胶水粘杯底\n- 操作方式：在老周常用的玻璃杯底涂一层强力胶，粘在吧台上。\n- 预期效果：老周端杯子时端不动，用力一扯把杯子扯碎。\n- 老周的反应：盯着杯底看半天，认出是你干的，默默换了个不锈钢杯。\n- 反制手段：之后给你上的酒一律用缺口的旧杯子，说是“配套”。\n- 危险度：★★★（可能割伤手，属于重点记仇项）","summary":null},{"metadata":{"_source":"knowledge","dataset_id":"08e2abca-e168-42ee-9cf1-85036e3066e9","dataset_name":"记仇酒馆·恶作剧图鉴","document_id":"da8a49c0-7b4a-4bf3-9786-1f21cee9e875","document_name":"prank_compendium.md","data_source_type":"upload_file","segment_id":"51a70d86-95bc-42d1-b7ae-ab4653c6ae73","retriever_from":"workflow","score":0.5060930637872593,"child_chunks":[],"segment_hit_count":17,"segment_word_count":161,"segment_position":7,"segment_index_node_hash":"d6c65ece495142d804d1b649ab8b02d535dd4ed5802f7820cb1dcaf6da5bad9b","doc_metadata":null,"position":3},"title":"prank_compendium.md","files":null,"content":"换掉招牌酒\n- 招式名：招牌酒掉包\n- 操作方式：把吧台后那瓶招牌陈酿换成颜色相近的廉价酒。\n- 预期效果：老周给熟客倒酒时被当场拆穿，面子上挂不住。\n- 老周的反应：先给客人赔笑换酒，转头把空瓶子摆在你面前当证据。\n- 反制手段：你的酒从此由他亲手从地窖取，当着你的面开瓶。\n- 危险度：★★★（砸招牌，老周最恨这一招）","summary":null}]},"inputs_truncated":false,"process_data":{},"process_data_truncated":false,"outputs":{"delta":5,"new_total":20,"reply":"老周怒骂一声，一把掀翻旁边的小桌，桌上的酒瓶摔得四分五裂，他瞪着你，怒气值直接爆表，怒气+5。","verdict":"暴怒","threat":"通缉令","memory_text":"玩家锯短了老周常坐的藤椅一条腿，老周把小桌掀翻，怒气 +5。","kb_titles":"prank_compendium.md"},"outputs_truncated":false,"status":"succeeded","error":null,"elapsed_time":0.055235,"execution_metadata":null,"created_at":1793605893,"finished_at":1793605893,"files":[],"iteration_id":null,"loop_id":null}}

